    "stem": "What is the output of the following code comparing `torch.tensor()`, `torch.as_tensor()`, and `torch.from_numpy()` when the underlying NumPy array is modified in-place?",
    "code": "import numpy as np\nimport torch\n\narr = np.array([10, 20, 30])\nt_copy = torch.tensor(arr)\nt_view1 = torch.as_tensor(arr)\nt_view2 = torch.from_numpy(arr)\n\narr[0] = 99\nprint(int(t_copy[0]), int(t_view1[0]), int(t_view2[0]))",
