    "stem": "What is the output of the following code using `torch.manual_seed`?",
    "code": "import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(123)\na = torch.rand(2)\nb = torch.rand(2)\n\ntorch.manual_seed(123)\nc = torch.rand(2)\n\nprint(torch.equal(a, b), torch.equal(a, c))",
