    "code": "import torch\n\nb = torch.tensor([True, False], dtype=torch.bool)\ni = torch.tensor([1, 2], dtype=torch.int32)\nf = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0], dtype=torch.float16)\nc = torch.tensor([1.0 + 0j, 2.0 + 0j], dtype=torch.complex64)\n\nprint((b + i).dtype, (i + f).dtype, (f + c).dtype)",
