      "D": "Instead of raising a shape error, `outputs - Y` broadcasts `(10, 1)` and `(10,)` into a `(10, 10)` pairwise difference matrix (comparing every prediction against every target in the batch) and emits a `UserWarning`, causing the model to train toward predicting the batch mean!"
