    "stem": "Examine the module below that uses both persistent and non-persistent buffers. Which keys will be present in `list(model.state_dict().keys())`?",
    "code": "import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\nclass BufferDemo(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.w = nn.Parameter(torch.ones(3))\n        self.register_buffer('running_scale', torch.tensor(2.0), persistent=True)\n        self.register_buffer('cached_mask', torch.zeros(3), persistent=False)\n        self.plain_tensor = torch.ones(3)\n\nmodel = BufferDemo()\nprint(list(model.state_dict().keys()))",
