      "C": "Incorrect because `model.eval()` only changes the behavior of layers like `Dropout` and `BatchNorm`; it does not disable gradient computation or parameter updates.",
      "D": "Incorrect because `with torch.no_grad():` around the entire forward pass prevents building the computation graph for `model.classifier` as well, causing `loss.backward()` to fail."
