    "stem": "Given the `TensorDataset` below with three tensors, what is returned when indexing `ds[4]`?",
    "code": "import torch\nfrom torch.utils.data import TensorDataset\n\nimages = torch.randn(20, 3, 32, 32)\ntabular = torch.randn(20, 5)\nlabels = torch.randint(0, 10, (20,))\n\nds = TensorDataset(images, tabular, labels)\nsample = ds[4]",
