    "stem": "You have two map-style datasets, `factory_a_ds` (1,200 samples) and `factory_b_ds` (800 samples), that return identically formatted `(image_tensor, label_int)` tuples. Which `torch.utils.data` utility combines them into a single unified map-style dataset of 2,000 samples without copying the underlying data in memory?",
