    "stem": "In `pytorch_data_utilities.ipynb`, when loading `datasets.FashionMNIST(root='data', train=True, download=True, transform=ToTensor())`, what happens if the FashionMNIST files have ALREADY been downloaded and extracted inside the `'data'` directory from a previous run?",
