    "code": "import torch\nfrom torch.utils.data import WeightedRandomSampler\n\n# labels is a 1D tensor of length 1000 containing 900 zeros and 100 ones\nclass_counts = torch.bincount(labels)          # tensor([900, 100])\nclass_weights = 1.0 / class_counts.float()     # tensor([1/900, 1/100])",
